## What to deliver

Build the Gloamfin sprite up operation by operation until the image in
`canvas.png` matches the brief — its eyeless silhouette, the deep-sea palette,
and the read of a forward-facing pursuer that hunts by echolocation. When you are
satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
